# The local stack only (P1.27l, P1.27m): replaces snippets/tls.caddy through one read-only mount at
# /etc/caddy/snippets/tls.caddy, so every site's `import tls` uses Caddy's internal, locally trusted CA instead of
# Let's Encrypt. Never copied into the image and never mounted by the dev or prod stack. Caddy v2.11.7 tls directive
# (caddyserver/website src/docs/markdown/caddyfile/directives/tls.md, "internal").
(tls) {
	tls internal
}
